{
  "name": "Translate Form Submissions (local test)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Local test variant — no external services except OpenAI\n\nSwaps:\n- Supabase vector store → In-Memory Vector Store (built into n8n)\n- Google Sheets → Write Binary File (saves to C:\\Users\\Administrator\\Desktop\\translations_log.json)\n- Slack alert node → disconnected\n\nOnly credential needed: OpenAI API key.\n\nTest with:\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook-test/translate-form-submissions-local \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"message\\\": \\\"Hola, necesito ayuda con mi pedido\\\", \\\"target_language\\\": \\\"English\\\"}\"",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, -340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "translate-form-submissions-local"
      },
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-300, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chunkSize": 400,
        "chunkOverlap": 40
      },
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Text Splitter",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.textSplitterCharacterTextSplitter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-130, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "text-embedding-3-small",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Embeddings",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [70, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "OPENAI_API",
          "name": "OpenAI"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Vector Store Insert",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreInMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [270, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "toolName": "translation_context",
        "toolDescription": "Retrieves relevant translation context"
      },
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "Vector Store Query",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreInMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [270, -180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Webhook Trigger').first().json.body.sessionId || $('Webhook Trigger').first().json.body.email || $execution.id }}"
      },
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
      "name": "Window Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [450, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000008",
      "name": "Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [450, -340],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "OPENAI_API",
          "name": "OpenAI"
        }
      }
    },
    {
    "parameters": {
      "agent": "toolsAgent",
      "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.body.message || $json.message }}\n\nTranslate the above text to: {{ $json.body.target_language || $json.target_language || 'English' }}\n\nReturn only the translated text, nothing else.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a professional translator. Translate the input text accurately to the requested target language. Return only the translated text with no explanation or extra formatting."
        }
      },
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000009",
      "name": "Translation Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
    "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [720, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toJson",
        "mode": "each",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "translation.json",
          "format": true
        }
      },
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
      "name": "Convert Agent Output to JSON File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [820, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fileName": "C:\\Users\\Administrator\\Desktop\\translations_log.json",
        "options": {
          "append": true
        }
      },
      "id": "f0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
      "name": "Save to File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.writeBinaryFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [930, -40]
    }
  ],
